      "value": "I've been meaning to make a report on this exact same issue\nThe problem appears to be that in the process of syncing the value, Udon changes it to an Int32\nThis then will cause an Udon exception as the code is expecting a Int16, and often ends up trying to pass an Int32 into an EXTERN that is expecting an Int16",
