  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Attached is an image that recreated the bug. To test, recreate the instance with the following setup and create an instance that has two players in it. The non-master player will see the cube freeze at scale (3, 3, 3), meaning that the next line of code was not executed. If you change syncRegistry to an int, it works correctly in this script.",
